+// compressionSystem returns the §4 body prompt with the output-language directive
+// appended. The prompt body is Chinese operational prose the model reads; the
+// directive is what forces the user-visible digest into the configured display
+// language. Every other role gets this via renderSystem (or, for the planner, an
+// explicit append); this call site builds its CompletionRequest by hand, so without
+// appending here a digest stays Chinese however ARTEX_LANG is set.
+func compressionSystem() string {
+	return compressionSystemPrompt + langDirective(resolveOutputLang())
+}
